+ *  Error codes list
+ *-*********************************************
+ *  Error codes _values_ are pinned down since v1.3.1 only.
+ *  Therefore, don't rely on values if you may link to any version < v1.3.1.
+ *
+ *  Only values < 100 are considered stable.
